# Veltrix Rule File — Hybrid Attack Mutation Rules
# Format: <operation>[argument]
# Operations:
#   $<n>    — append number 0..n
#   ^<n>    — prepend number 0..n
#   @<str>  — append string
#   !<str>  — prepend string
#   ~<n>    — capitalize (0=lower, 1=upper, 2=title)
#   &<from>:<to> — leet speak substitution
#
# Order: rules are applied sequentially per word

# ── Year suffixes ──
$2024
$2025
$2026
$2023
$2020
$2019
$2018
$2017
$2016
$2015
$2024!

# ── Common appends ──
@123
@123456
@1234
@1
@!
@2024
@admin
@pass
@me

# ── Common prepends ──
!admin
!pass
!Admin
!super
!root

# ── Capitalization ──
~1
~2

# ── Leet speak ──
&a:@
&a:4
&e:3
&i:1
&o:0
&s:$
&s:5
&t:7
